# todo-list-cli

A command-line todo list in Scala 3, grown spec-first, one milestone per commit.
---settings---
{
  "hooks": {
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/log-prompt.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
